A clean checkout of origin/main (1338d0b) did not compile. Four independent
integrity defects, all the same failure mode: a commit that landed the caller
but withheld the callee.

FIX-1  lib.rs declared `pub mod performance;` and `pub mod system_integration;`
       but neither file was ever committed (verified: git log --all
       --diff-filter=A returns empty for both). Introduced by 5f5a99e, which
       declared three modules and added only real_tools.rs.
       Repair (option C): remove the 2 declarations + 2 re-exports.

FIX-2  enhanced_bridge.rs called 8x self.get_more_*_tools(), implemented in no
       commit. Introduced by 29cc936 (call sites only).
       Committing the 113 uncommitted definitions was REJECTED: every tool
       routes to BuiltinTool::call(), which sleeps 10ms and returns
       success:true without executing anything (committed at HEAD). That is
       fabricated execution. The bridge is also unreachable from the desktop
       app, which uses ZylCodeEngine + execute_with_recovery.
       Repair (option C): remove the 8 call sites.

FIX-3  zylcode-core imports ToolSchema/RiskLevel and calls list_schemas(),
       none present in zylcode-mcp. Added by 158370f against uncommitted
       symbols. NOT anticipated by the work order.
       Repair: add RiskLevel + ToolSchema (22 lines) and
       ToolRegistry::list_schemas() (31 lines). The 338-line real_tools.rs
       refactor in the dirty tree was NOT committed — only what
       zylcode-core structurally requires.

FIX-4  agent_loop_e2e.rs called AgentLoop::new with 5 args; the fn takes 6.
       memory_ledger.rs is committed; only the test had not caught up.
       NOT anticipated by the work order.

Also not anticipated: crates/zylcode-mcp/tests/integration_test.rs is
committed and asserts tool_count >= 100 (actual 28) and dev_tools >= 25
(actual 11). Neither can pass on any clean checkout. NOT repaired here --
suppressing the assertions would be a builder certifying its own work.
Recorded as an open product decision.

Verification, clean worktree detached from origin/main:
  cargo check --workspace --all-targets            EXIT 0, 0 errors
  git diff --check                                 EXIT 0
  no required source exists only as untracked      confirmed
  cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings   EXIT 1 (31 pre-existing)
